@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 1. Cadastrar Meia Lua
# @name jogador
POST {{host}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Meia Lua", "position": "MEI", "agility": 85, "age": 25,
  "pace": 70, "shooting": 68, "passing": 82, "dribbling": 79, "defending": 55, "physical": 64, "potential": 86 }

### 2. MAL_CONDICIONADO (market_value 37)
PATCH {{host}}/players/{{jogador.response.body.id}}/condition
Content-Type: application/json

{ "condition": "MAL_CONDICIONADO" }

### 3. Criar clube
# @name clube
POST {{host}}/clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Águias FC", "acronym": "AGU" }

### 4. Comprar (valor 37, taxa 1,85, caixa 261,15)
POST {{host}}/players/{{jogador.response.body.id}}/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "club_id": {{clube.response.body.id}}, "loyalty_until": "2027-03-02T10:15-03:00" }

### 5. Consultar o clube
GET {{host}}/clubs/{{clube.response.body.id}}

### 6. Voltar a APTO
PATCH {{host}}/players/{{jogador.response.body.id}}/condition
Content-Type: application/json

{ "condition": "APTO" }

### 7. Vender
POST {{host}}/players/{{jogador.response.body.id}}/sell

### 8. Histórico (conferir: 300 + soma das variações = caixa)
GET {{host}}/clubs/{{clube.response.body.id}}/transactions

### 9. CSV
GET {{host}}/clubs/{{clube.response.body.id}}/transactions/export

### 10. Recompra recusada (409)
POST {{host}}/players/{{jogador.response.body.id}}/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "club_id": {{clube.response.body.id}}, "loyalty_until": "2027-03-02T10:15-03:00" }

### 11. Lista de clubes por patrimônio
GET {{host}}/clubs?sort=net_worth_desc

### 12. Lista de jogadores com filtros
GET {{host}}/players?search=lua&sort=value_desc,age_asc&page=1&limit=10

### 13. Venda de jogador livre (409) e id inválido (404)
POST {{host}}/players/01/sell

### 00. outras requisiçoes

### 400: sigla que não bate com o nome
POST {{host}}/clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Delta FC", "acronym": "XYZ" }

### 409: nome repetido com outra caixa
POST {{host}}/clubs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "águias fc", "acronym": "AGU" }

### 400: data de fidelidade sem fuso
POST {{host}}/players/1/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "club_id": 1, "loyalty_until": "2027-03-02T10:15" }

### 400: filtro inválido no histórico
GET {{host}}/clubs/1/transactions?type=COMPRA,venda